    {
      "q": "Is the Mount Druitt Service Centre accessible?",
      "a": "Yes, the centre offers wheelchair access, entry at street level, and is located within a shopping centre. It also provides Auslan video remote interpreting, a hearing loop, quiet hour, and remote live captioning.",
      "link": null
